                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Didn't finish unfortunately. It doesn't motivate me that much. The game has good pixel art and okay music but it could have some more variety. The physics are also a bit wonky and that's why I dropped the game. Game decided to change the trajectory of the ball without any logical explanation. That happened quite a lot. Also, the story is non existent. Can't recommend it as it is.",
